From: "exe.dev user" <exedev@erbium-qemu.exe.xyz>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 23:19:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/7] erbium-xspi: follow RTL semantics (latency 8+IL, AXI
 burst limits, 4K write wrap, SCCR at 0x4000F000, SFDP pad quirk, chip reset)

Co-authored-by: Shelley <shelley@exe.dev>
---
